            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Yoly"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I used a Honey Crisp apple and did not bother to peel it. I found it a bit on the dry side, hence the 4 star rating. A tasty salad that I would make again.",
            "datePublished": "2021-08-19T22:54:02.690Z"
          },
          {
