            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Paula"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I cut the recipe in half since it was just for me; however, I ended up using the full amount of mayo and oil. I didn’t think I would like the addition of dill, so I started with considerably less than called for but ended up using all of it. I was surprised at how well the dill and apple complemented each other. A really nice variation for tuna salad!",
            "datePublished": "2021-08-07T16:51:31.383Z"
          },
